        "created_at": "2021-08-03T21:25:56.438Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi there.</p>\n<p>So, I just finished a game with the <a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=Dahan_Insurrection#tab=Scenario:_Dahan_Insurrection\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Dahan Insurrection</a> Scenario and found a point that needed clarifying.</p>\n<p>The aforementioned Scenario reads in part . . .</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Military Response:</strong> Whenever a City is destroyed, add 1 Town to the nearest land with Dahan. Whenever a Town is destroyed, add 1 Explorer to the nearest land with Dahan.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Does “the nearest land with Dahan” count the land where the building was destroyed?</p>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Land A contains 1 Town and 1 Dahan. Land B contains 1 Dahan and is the nearest land containing Dahan in relation to Land A, other than Land A. The Town in Land A is destroyed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Is the Explorer added to Land A or Land B?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-08-03T21:25:56.438Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 554,
        "reads": 20,
        "readers_count": 19,
        "score": 2774.0,
